* GND/VCC bounce model - SN74ALVC244 SOIC (DW), IBIS component ALVC244_DW - board ref Q3
* Driver XD_*: linear model, pull-up/pull-down resistors controlled by the input (Ron = 11 ohm, 500 ps ramp), defined in bounce_models.lib.
* Package: IBIS [Pin] R_pin and L_pin in series, C_pin split as C/2 at the die side (Cpd) and C/2 at the board side (Cpb).
* Die: C_comp split as Cup (to VCC_DIE) and Cdn (to GND_DIE). C_die = on-die VCC-GND capacitance. Shared die rails VCC_DIE / GND_DIE.
* Lines: Rs + lossless T-line (built-in tline) + receiver C_rx = IBIS input C_comp (4.21 pF, ALVC244_IN_33) + C_pin of the receiving pin. 8th line (MON): no Rs, scope 50 ohm.
* One run steps Nact = 1, 3, 7 active lines. MON=0: 8th line low -> GND bounce. MON=1: 8th line high -> VCC bounce.
* Plot V(mon_scope) (scope), V(gnd_die) / V(vcc_die) (chip rails), V(l1_rx) (timing reference).
* Board supply: ideal 3.3 V at the board side of the VCC pin (R_brd, L_brd removed) and 100 nF decoupling
* C73 / C79, 100 nF 0805
* VCC pin 20 (IBIS): Cpb - Rp - Lp - Cpd
* GND pin 10 (IBIS): Rp - Lp - Cpd
* on-die VCC-GND C
* Clock: 20 MHz, 0..1 V control, 500 ps edges
* 8th-line control (MON)
* Simulation settings (MON: 0 = 8th line low -> GND bounce, 1 = high -> VCC bounce)
.include bounce_models.lib
.param MON=0
.step param Nact list 1 3 7
.tran 0 60n 0 5p
.options plotwinsize=0
.options method=gear
.meas TRAN GND_max MAX V(GND_DIE) FROM 4n TO 60n
.meas TRAN GND_min MIN V(GND_DIE) FROM 4n TO 60n
.meas TRAN VCC_max MAX V(VCC_DIE) FROM 4n TO 60n
.meas TRAN VCC_min MIN V(VCC_DIE) FROM 4n TO 60n
.meas TRAN MON_dc FIND V(MON_SCOPE) AT 4n
.meas TRAN MON_max MAX V(MON_SCOPE) FROM 4n TO 60n
.meas TRAN MON_min MIN V(MON_SCOPE) FROM 4n TO 60n
* .meas results: View > SPICE Error Log (one set per Nact).
* All component values are written on the components - edit them there.
* scope 50 ohm (P40, ch2 1x)
* MON: 2Y4 (pin 3) - 8th line (monitor): held at MON, input 2A4 set by J3/J6
* L1: 2Y3 (pin 5) - toggles for N=1,3,7 (2A3 <- clock bank 2, J8) | receiver Q4 2A3 (pin 15): C_rx = 4.21p + 0.533p
* L2: 1Y1 (pin 18) - toggles for N=3,7; Hi-Z for N=1 (1OE off) | receiver Q4 1A1 (pin 2): C_rx = 4.21p + 0.867p
* L3: 1Y2 (pin 16) - toggles for N=3,7; Hi-Z for N=1 (1OE off) | receiver Q4 1A2 (pin 4): C_rx = 4.21p + 0.591p
* L4: 1Y3 (pin 14) - toggles for N=7; quiet low N=3; Hi-Z N=1 | receiver Q4 1A3 (pin 6): C_rx = 4.21p + 0.530p
* L5: 1Y4 (pin 12) - toggles for N=7; quiet low N=3; Hi-Z N=1 | receiver Q4 1A4 (pin 8): C_rx = 4.21p + 0.726p
* L6: 2Y1 (pin 9) - toggles for N=7; quiet low for N=1,3 | receiver Q4 2A1 (pin 11): C_rx = 4.21p + 0.861p
* L7: 2Y2 (pin 7) - toggles for N=7; quiet low for N=1,3 | receiver Q4 2A2 (pin 13): C_rx = 4.21p + 0.742p
.backanno
.end
